      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "How flexible is »coraMachineLoad« when it comes to adjusting to different machines and tool types?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>»coraMachineLoad« is extremely flexible and can be easily adjusted to various machine and tool types. Thanks to the robotic arm, a wide variety of magazine types can be filled, regardless of the manufacturer. The system is reliable, operates completely autonomously, and is highly efficient.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c2568",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What effect does automatic machine loading have on production speed and efficiency?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>By performing setup in parallel with production time using central tool magazines, »coraMachineLoad« keeps your machines moving and thus prevents machine downtime.</p> <p>»coraMachineLoad« has no negative effect on production speed or efficiency. On the contrary, by automating the use of machine tools, »coraMachineLoad« increases your efficiency and, consequently, your productivity.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c2566",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
